            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nI can not reproduce. With provided config any \"in\" and \"out\" movement work as expected. Closing after 1 second probably means that some window got closed when it wasn't supposed to.\r\n\r\nI'd ask you for more information:\r\n- Does any of `:nmap <Left>` or `:nmap <Right>` show anything not related to 'mini.files' *when executed inside active explorer*?\r\n- Do you know the commit (either from 'mini.nvim' or standalone 'mini.files') at which you had everything work?\r\n- Can you reproduce this with  *only* 'mini.files' set up?",
