            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I posted this and was going to edit with the reproduction steps (you are too quick to answer!) and... I can't reproduce it when I do as minimal as possible (using vanilla NvChad with just mini.files set up).\r\n\r\nSo, it seems there is something that is highjacking or also uses left and right that causes it.\r\n\r\nThe commit where it worked is this one: 1b5ada9d3a0df36cfbf7f50a314646c0673b8c87\r\n\r\nI'll check out the :nmap on left and right. Thanks for the tip.\r\nI also think we can close this as it's not an issue with mini.files as I can't reproduce with a clean slate.",
