            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I ran the nmap command on an open explorer and got the following:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e46143f7-6bd4-4d73-93f8-8ef3c60ebf2a)\r\nand the same for Right but \"Go in entry plus\" instead of course.\r\n\r\nI ran the nmap on a file with no explorer open and I get \"No mapping found\".\r\n\r\nI'm thinking that maybe I want to start over with a clean NvChad and I'll lift everything over as if I just started from that one instead of all the upgrading I've done over the years.",
