            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I posted this and was going to edit with the reproduction steps (you are too quick to answer!) and...\r\n\r\nSorry :shrug: :smile:\r\n\r\n> The commit where it worked is this one: 1b5ada9d3a0df36cfbf7f50a314646c0673b8c87\r\n\r\nWell, there was a change in how windows are handled, but I can't see how this can break custom mappings. Definitely not without reproduction steps, sorry :( And also mappings output seems to be ok.\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nClosing for now. Feel free to post reproduction steps here if you manage to find them.",
