        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "...and I managed to fix the issue I had!\r\n\r\nIt was not related at all to mini.files. It was also not related to NvChad.\r\n\r\nThe issue was that my chadrc (settingsfile for NvChad) required the mappings file. It used to have to do that. Then a lot has changed and I do not need to require the mappings anymore (I realized this when I ran NvChad out of the box).\r\n\r\nSo I guess the file was read automatically and then I also tried requiring it.\r\n\r\nThis issue can be closed, buried and forgotten I think.\r\n\r\nI just want to give massive thanks to you @echasnovski for the mini plugins, I use a few of them and they are awsome. Also that you're so darn quick to answer. <3",
